{"id":"9d5826a0b09d31cb","group":"67","path":"67/67-thm-lindstrom-characterization.md","title":"Lindström Characterization with Explicit Regularity","display":"thm-lindstrom-characterization — Lindström Characterization with Explicit Regularity","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Aspects of Incompleteness Lindstrom","book_abbrev":"67","label":"67-thm-lindstrom-characterization","aliases":["67-thm-lindstrom-characterization"],"display":"thm-lindstrom-characterization — Lindström Characterization with Explicit Regularity","depends_on":["[[67-df-abstract-logic]]","[[67-df-compactness-property]]","[[67-df-lowenheim-skolem-property]]"],"revision_status":"locally-reconstructed","machine_verified":false,"verification_status":"local-interface-and-dependency-checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false,"revision_date":"2026-10-14"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Aspects of Incompleteness Lindstrom"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"67"},{"key":"label","html":"67-thm-lindstrom-characterization"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>67-thm-lindstrom-characterization</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-lindstrom-characterization — Lindström Characterization with Explicit Regularity"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"e5558885fabd8e01\" href=\"?note=e5558885fabd8e01\" title=\"67-df-abstract-logic\">67-df-abstract-logic</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"226cc20b75e0d203\" href=\"?note=226cc20b75e0d203\" title=\"67-df-compactness-property\">67-df-compactness-property</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"8f108f9f48f06aa6\" href=\"?note=8f108f9f48f06aa6\" title=\"67-df-lowenheim-skolem-property\">67-df-lowenheim-skolem-property</a></span></div>"},{"key":"revision_status","html":"locally-reconstructed"},{"key":"machine_verified","html":"false"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"local-interface-and-dependency-checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"revision_date","html":"2026-10-14"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L\">\\(\\mathcal L\\)</span> 为 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"e5558885fabd8e01\" href=\"?note=e5558885fabd8e01\" title=\"67-df-abstract-logic\">67-df-abstract-logic</a> 的候选逻辑，正则性及扩张一阶逻辑的所有要求统一取其中的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RegFO}(\\mathcal L)\">\\(\\mathrm{RegFO}(\\mathcal L)\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Compact}\">\\(\\mathrm{Compact}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LS}\">\\(\\mathrm{LS}\\)</span> 分别取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"226cc20b75e0d203\" href=\"?note=226cc20b75e0d203\" title=\"67-df-compactness-property\">67-df-compactness-property</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"8f108f9f48f06aa6\" href=\"?note=8f108f9f48f06aa6\" title=\"67-df-lowenheim-skolem-property\">67-df-lowenheim-skolem-property</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\equiv\\mathrm{FO}\">\\(\\equiv\\mathrm{FO}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"e5558885fabd8e01\" href=\"?note=e5558885fabd8e01\" title=\"67-df-abstract-logic\">67-df-abstract-logic</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RegFO}(\\mathcal L)\\land\\mathrm{Compact}(\\mathcal L)\\land\\mathrm{LS}(\\mathcal L)\n\\Longrightarrow\\mathcal L\\equiv\\mathrm{FO}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{RegFO}(\\mathcal L)\\land\\mathrm{Compact}(\\mathcal L)\\land\\mathrm{LS}(\\mathcal L)\n\\Longrightarrow\\mathcal L\\equiv\\mathrm{FO}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>这是原第57册悬空定理在本册所需的版本。此处采用的 LS 性质蕴含可数签名下可满足句子集有可数模型；正则性没有从 Compact 或 LS 中偷偷省略。重建条件亦参照 van Benthem–ten Cate–Väänänen, Lindström Theorems for Fragments of First-Order Logic, arXiv:0905.3668。本文给出精确命题及依赖，不提供机器证明。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"67-df-abstract-logic","status":"resolved","id":"e5558885fabd8e01","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-abstract-logic]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-compactness-property","status":"resolved","id":"226cc20b75e0d203","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-compactness-property]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-lowenheim-skolem-property","status":"resolved","id":"8f108f9f48f06aa6","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-lowenheim-skolem-property]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-abstract-logic","status":"resolved","id":"e5558885fabd8e01","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal L$ 为 [[67-df-abstract-logic]] 的候选逻辑，正则性及扩张一阶逻辑的所有要求统一取其中的 $\\mathrm{RegFO}(\\mathcal L)$。","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-compactness-property","status":"resolved","id":"226cc20b75e0d203","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Compact}$、$\\mathrm{LS}$ 分别取 [[67-df-compactness-property]]、[[67-df-lowenheim-skolem-property]]；$\\equiv\\mathrm{FO}$ 取 [[67-df-abstract-logic]]。","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-lowenheim-skolem-property","status":"resolved","id":"8f108f9f48f06aa6","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Compact}$、$\\mathrm{LS}$ 分别取 [[67-df-compactness-property]]、[[67-df-lowenheim-skolem-property]]；$\\equiv\\mathrm{FO}$ 取 [[67-df-abs